  "problem": "$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix above. Find its decomposition using Jordan blocks.",
